>Was this a wise choice, i assumed that anything crystal would not be affect by things that
>damage regular armor, that's why i put it on, am i right?

>also what's better bronze platemail or crystal platemail (he also found some bronze stuff too)??

Crystal is better.  If I'm right, Bronze gives you +6 AC and both regular
and crystal plate give you +7, ie, Wearing bronze gives you an AC of 4 while
crystal and regular plates give you an AC of 3.  The difference is that
Bronze mail also does not rust.

If I were you, I would have kept the +3 plate mail and put on a cloak.
This protects you from rust too.

